  Bookmark,
  Save,
  Clock,
  CheckCircle2,
  Eraser,
  Search,
  Loader2,
  Sun,
  Cloud,
  BookOpen,
  User,
  Trees,
  Home,
  Building2,
  Coffee,
  Shapes,
  Bug,
